# Sunleaf Terraces -- town, 20x18 (buffer 624/1300), ref VioletCity (roof colour TBD)
# HOOK: a farming village stepped up a hillside. Four terraces separated by grass
#   ledges (57); the only up-paths are single gaps that switchback (bottom gap E,
#   middle gap W, top gap centre), while every ledge is a one-way hop back down.
#   It is the hack's Leppa-berry hub for the no-Pokemon-Center PP economy.
# TERRACES (bottom to top):
#   1 Village row: Inn (18 19/1a 11, PC + waypoint, no heal), Seed Mart (18 19/16 17),
#     a produce stand (ad, StandKeeper sells Leppa/status berries), town sign.
#   2 Sprout field: fenced crop rows of ae (sprouts) + two houses. HarvestGranny
#     at the field edge comments on the crop by season (checkseason).
#   3 Berry beds: eight 7b soft-soil beds in two rows with dirt lanes = the
#     plant/tend/harvest system (bg_events per bed). Three Leppa fruit trees on the
#     east lawn, a little tall grass behind them, Farmer_soil explains planting.
#   4 Leppa Farm: big farmhouse (2c 2a 2d/26 27 2f), stone well/cistern (82),
#     irrigation reservoir pond (54 76 55/58 35 59). BerryMaster gives the first
#     Leppa + a daily berry. Item ball on the reservoir bank (reachable).
# ITEMS: reservoir item, hidden item by the reservoir, hidden item beside the beds.
#   Youngster_ledges on terrace 3 teaches "hop down = fast way home".
# ATTACH: S -> Route 36 (cut a gap in its north tree wall, north of Violet);
#   W -> stub toward Route 31/Dark Cave side. Indoors: farmhouse, inn, mart, 2 houses.
# TILE GAPS: no windmill / scarecrow; stand-ins only. 7b/ae/ad are unused in vanilla
#   Johto maps (check shasocastris has not reserved them). Winter: beds stay brown soil and
#   sprouts stay brown, which reads as a fallow field -- fine.
ref VioletCity
key 1=2c A=2a 2=2d 5=26 6=27 4=2f W=82 h=7b e=ae q=48 w=49 f=4a K=11 d=ad
key P=18 p=19 J=16 j=1e c=1a b=1b M=17 l=4b L=5a
grid:
TTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTT
TT,1A2,,,,TT(^^^)TTT
TT,564,,W,,,[~~~]TTT
TT,,.....,,,,,,,,,TT
TT===..==========TTT
TT.h.h.h.h.,,,,,,TTT
TT.h.h.h.h.,"""",TTT
TT,.........,,,,,TTT
TT=.==============TT
TT.,qwwwwf,Pp,Pp,,TT
TT.,eeeeee,Jj,Jj,,TT
TT.,eeeeee,.......TT
TT==============.=TT
TT,Pp,,d,,*,,Pp,.,TT
TT,cK,,,,*,,,JM,.,TT
......s...........TT
TT,,**,,,..,,**,,,TT
TTTTTTTTT..TTTTTTTTT
end
exit W 0 30
exit S 19 35
exit FARM 8 5
exit INN 7 29
exit HOUSE1 23 21
exit HOUSE2 29 21
exit MART 27 29
obj warp 8 5 LeppaFarmhouse
obj warp 7 29 Inn
obj warp 23 21 house1
obj warp 29 21 house2
obj warp 27 29 SeedMart
obj fruit 24 10 leppa
obj fruit 28 10 leppa
obj fruit 32 10 leppa
obj npc 12 7 BerryMaster down
obj npc 10 14 Farmer_soil up
obj npc 19 21 HarvestGranny left
obj npc 16 27 StandKeeper left
obj sign 12 30 TownSign
obj item 34 6 reservoir_item
obj hidden 22 4 reservoir_bank_hidden
obj hidden 5 11 bed_hidden
obj npc 32 14 Youngster_ledges left
